# Charter

valmorph is a standalone study of validation-gated self-modifying networks. Do not read or import other repositories on this machine.

Read `docs/STATE.md` first. Update `docs/STATE.md` and `docs/09_JOURNAL.md` last.

The current phase in STATE is the only phase you implement. Smoke stays inside the 0.20 memory cap. No training loop until Phase 1's exit criteria are the task.

Two outputs matter: a system that runs on the image protocol and the stream, and ledger-backed figures. A negative result is written down. A synthetic ledger is not a result.

The MacBook Pro M4 (24 GB) and the RTX 5080 are both development machines. Canonical CUDA numbers come from the 5080 only. Never pool them.
